1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The Clover Kingdom.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
In this place where magic is everything,

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
there lives one boy who was born without it.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
His name is Asta.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
His strength and determination helped him become a magic knight.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
And despite the many challenges he faces,

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
he aims for the top and refuses to give up.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Rich or poor, royalty or commoner,

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Asta believes anyone can shine.

10
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
His mission is to prove that to the whole world

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
and to become the next Wizard King.

12
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
After barging into the Black Bull's hideout unannounced,

13
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Meraleona marched out with Asta and company in tow.

14
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Their destination, the Yoltim Volcano,

15
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,000
a strong magic region where Asta and Noelle

16
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
had previously trained with the Crimson Lion Kings.

17
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:57,000
There, Meraleona and Voigoleon had arranged another training session

18
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,000
in preparation for their battle with the Devil.

19
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Let's race to the top so we can hit that sweet hot spring!

20
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Hold it!

21
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,000
There'll be no climbing this time.

22
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Instead, I'm going to have you venture below.

23
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,000
To the underground cave!

24
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,000
As the young wizards approached the hot springs that marked the end of their path,

25
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,000
they encountered a new mana blazing with an intensity they had never seen before.

26
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,000
But then...

27
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Eat this!

28
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Flame magic!

29
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Viral flame!

30
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:38,000
A powerful spell from Leopold was enough to ward off the monstrous spider.

31
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:42,000
And soon after, another of the cave's secrets was revealed.

32
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Where does that door lead to?

33
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Ah!

34
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Dungeons!

35
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,000
This ought to be interesting.

36
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,000
Villainemöl

37
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:54,000
In the next episode,

38
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,600
110 sensualzy

39
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:01,720
Post-Rawful

40
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Part소

41
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:15,000
If you areечение,

42
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:25,000
風吹く世界の果てで僕らは今日も目を閉じる夢を見る飽きもせず

43
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:43,000
今は小さく儚い希望もいつか時代を変えてゆく光になると信じて背負うべきものなど何一つないさ全て抱きしめてゆく

44
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:53,000
例えばそれが痛みだとしても叶うなら君と共に

45
00:02:53,000 --> 00:03:00,000
この声がこの喉が振り切れるほど今叫ぶよ

46
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:11,000
未来は自分で切り開くんだってとめとなく溢れ出る情熱のままさ歩き出そう

47
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:17,000
風吹く世界の夢を見る

48
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:19,000
2018発表

49
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:27,000
チーム明真理光

50
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:29,000
心の意味込む

51
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,000
サンフレオネと迷众

52
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:37,320
Captain Merleona, what's happening here?

53
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:38,200
You're late!

54
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:43,040
You weren't called out here for a leisurely stroll with your Black Bull buddies, you weaklings!

55
00:03:43,540 --> 00:03:45,860
You call yourselves Crimson Lion Kings!

56
00:03:46,580 --> 00:03:48,040
We beg your forgiveness.

57
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:52,280
We would have gotten here faster if it had been just the Vice-Captain and me.

58
00:03:52,940 --> 00:03:54,680
We are unworthy of our station.

59
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:55,860
And you?

60
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:58,780
Nobody gave you permission to eat!

61
00:03:58,780 --> 00:04:03,120
Oh, come on, Charmy, read the room, would you? This really isn't the time for a snack!

62
00:04:03,380 --> 00:04:08,640
We've already reported our discovery to the Royal Capital. You are to wait here for instructions.

63
00:04:09,180 --> 00:04:09,840
Yes, sir!

64
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:15,440
What?

65
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:19,120
Hold on, are you saying that giant spider came after you guys, too?

66
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:23,520
Yeah, and just like that, that thing bugged off into some mystery dungeon.

67
00:04:23,660 --> 00:04:24,740
Right? I'm so ready!

68
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:25,940
Ready for what?

69
00:04:25,940 --> 00:04:29,620
I was a fool to let that spider escape.

70
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:31,500
This can't be how it ends.

71
00:04:33,940 --> 00:04:34,340
Sister!

72
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:37,640
We wish to explore that dungeon as well!

73
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,300
Don't get cocky!

74
00:04:40,820 --> 00:04:44,700
You're the incompetent weakling who let that bug get away to begin with, fool!

75
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:47,920
You've got some nerve asking anything of me after that!

76
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:50,520
But next time, I know I can defeat it!

77
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:52,940
There is no next time in battle!

78
00:04:56,860 --> 00:05:01,260
Now get your head on straight by fighting your way through that dungeon!

79
00:05:01,820 --> 00:05:02,620
Yes, ma'am.

80
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:05,340
Man, she's still as hot blooded as ever!

81
00:05:05,580 --> 00:05:07,680
Wasn't that exactly what he was asking for?

82
00:05:08,140 --> 00:05:09,360
All eyes up here!

83
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:12,840
Alright then, Captain Foygolion filled me in.

84
00:05:13,620 --> 00:05:17,760
Deep in that dungeon you discovered, we believe there's a powerful magic item.

85
00:05:20,260 --> 00:05:27,500
According to a book that Master Julius found in the library, it was sealed away somewhere inside the Yoltam Volcano centuries ago,

86
00:05:27,500 --> 00:05:30,620
out of fear that its power might someday be used for evil.

87
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:35,420
Unfortunately, the records contain nothing specific about the item itself.

88
00:05:36,300 --> 00:05:37,760
That's right! It's a total mystery!

89
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:39,420
I don't need help explaining.

90
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:41,120
Now please be quiet!

91
00:05:41,460 --> 00:05:42,220
Sorry to interrupt.

92
00:05:42,500 --> 00:05:45,540
I'm just so excited to learn about this long-lost mystery artifact.

93
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:48,520
Actually, can I go there too?

94
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:50,040
Absolutely not!

95
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:51,860
Why? I'll wear a disguise!

96
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:53,780
It's entirely beside the point!

97
00:05:54,180 --> 00:05:56,640
Who do you think he's talking to? I'm not sure.

98
00:05:56,640 --> 00:05:58,100
Yeah, I know that voice.

99
00:05:58,340 --> 00:05:59,340
The Wizard King.

100
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:03,560
In any case, this magic item will be key in restoring our kingdom,

101
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:06,420
along with any other treasure you might find inside the dungeon.

102
00:06:07,220 --> 00:06:09,260
I ask that you all conduct your search thoroughly.

103
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:10,720
Understood.

104
00:06:11,340 --> 00:06:12,200
Now then!

105
00:06:12,660 --> 00:06:13,800
Listen here, fools!

106
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:17,280
You're all staking your pride as magic knights on this!

107
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:18,720
Do it for your kingdom!

108
00:06:19,220 --> 00:06:19,900
Yes, ma'am!

109
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,440
Please, sister.

110
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:24,820
As the current captain, I should be the one to conclude this briefing.

111
00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:25,820
Fine.

112
00:06:25,820 --> 00:06:27,820
Hurry up and get on with it.

113
00:06:29,980 --> 00:06:33,780
Asta, Noelle, Leo, Randall, Luck, and Magna.

114
00:06:34,580 --> 00:06:36,940
You are to take the lead and locate the magic item.

115
00:06:37,940 --> 00:06:41,700
The rest of you will rendezvous with these six as soon as your mana has recovered.

116
00:06:42,300 --> 00:06:44,480
I'm just gonna head down there real quick.

117
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:46,180
You will do no such thing.

118
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:47,480
I'm ready.

119
00:06:47,620 --> 00:06:48,520
Let's do this!

120
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:49,140
Yeah!

121
00:06:49,140 --> 00:06:49,300
Yeah!

122
00:07:01,180 --> 00:07:01,700
Ouch!

123
00:07:01,700 --> 00:07:14,880
Damn, I thought it was hot before, but that was nothing compared to this.

124
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:17,500
I don't sense that spider's mana at all.

125
00:07:18,020 --> 00:07:18,400
Uh-oh.

126
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:27,920
Skillfully done, rifle.

127
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,880
You've disarmed the first trap already.

128
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:31,620
It's not like I did that on purpose.

129
00:07:31,620 --> 00:07:38,100
We can't afford to get bogged down here for too long.

130
00:07:38,100 --> 00:07:51,520
He used just enough power to reveal them without triggering them.

131
00:07:51,940 --> 00:07:53,180
That was high-level magic.

132
00:07:53,620 --> 00:07:54,960
And he made it look easy.

133
00:07:55,660 --> 00:07:58,400
So that's the vice-captain of the Crimson Lion Kings.

134
00:07:58,740 --> 00:08:02,060
Now that they're all lit up like this, we can spot these traps with our eyes shut.

135
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:03,580
Later, you guys!

136
00:08:04,300 --> 00:08:05,600
Lightning creation magic!

137
00:08:05,900 --> 00:08:06,980
Holy lightning boost!

138
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:08,620
I wasn't ready!

139
00:08:09,380 --> 00:08:10,900
Flame reinforcement magic!

140
00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:12,520
Risky stolen base!

141
00:08:17,340 --> 00:08:17,900
Hey!

142
00:08:18,180 --> 00:08:19,600
Don't set him off in front of me!

143
00:08:21,740 --> 00:08:24,160
Well, Asta, looks like the middle path's been claimed,

144
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,120
so let's split up here.

145
00:08:25,340 --> 00:08:28,060
Whichever team finds the magic item first, wins the race!

146
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:29,380
All right, you're on!

147
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:41,820
I'm amazed Leo can move so easily in mana this dense.

148
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:45,100
We need to be quick, vice-captain Randall!

149
00:08:45,820 --> 00:08:46,440
Got it.

150
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:48,100
I have to say, Leo,

151
00:08:48,260 --> 00:08:51,700
it's obvious that you've been training far harder than anyone else in the squad.

152
00:08:51,700 --> 00:08:54,760
And yet, I'm still not strong enough to catch up with my rival,

153
00:08:54,880 --> 00:08:56,240
let alone surpass him!

154
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,240
In his recent battle,

155
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:01,400
Asta went toe-to-toe with the Devil,

156
00:09:01,760 --> 00:09:02,320
and won.

157
00:09:03,160 --> 00:09:03,740
What's more,

158
00:09:04,140 --> 00:09:06,660
I heard that the other Black Bulls also fought valiantly.

159
00:09:07,540 --> 00:09:09,600
This training can hardly compare.

160
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,000
So that's it.

161
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:16,500
Now I see why the captains invited the Black Bulls to take part in this exercise with us.

162
00:09:16,500 --> 00:09:19,120
Don't sell yourself short, Leo.

163
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:22,100
I think that last battle brought you to the verge of a breakthrough.

164
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:26,920
It hit you when you had to face off with me after that elf took over my body.

165
00:09:31,260 --> 00:09:34,880
I'm sure I could sense violent intent in that surge of mana just now.

166
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:36,980
Let's check it out.

167
00:09:36,980 --> 00:09:55,080
Come on!

168
00:09:55,280 --> 00:09:58,100
It's only gonna get worse if we can't smash our way through this!

169
00:09:58,640 --> 00:10:02,080
Charging through a dungeon full of traps might be fine for a meathead like you,

170
00:10:02,160 --> 00:10:04,080
but that's not how I do things, okay?

171
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:06,120
Then just let me carry you!

172
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:06,760
Huh?

173
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:10,720
You can hop on my back and keep casting spells while I get us out of here!

174
00:10:10,940 --> 00:10:12,680
You want me to hop on your back?

175
00:10:12,980 --> 00:10:13,840
I refuse!

176
00:10:13,980 --> 00:10:16,080
I'm royalty, and that's beneath my dignity!

177
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:18,360
Let's go!

178
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:20,480
Asta?

179
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:25,160
Wait a sec, why are we turning around?

180
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:29,920
We're-we're pulling back for now!

181
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:30,700
A-ha!

182
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:34,580
A-ha!

183
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,240
Is this...

184
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,120
Look up!

185
00:10:44,920 --> 00:10:47,160
Those must be the golems that were guarding this place.

186
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:48,820
Stay sharp.

187
00:10:48,980 --> 00:10:53,220
The spider may have sent out that blast of violent mana before because it wanted us to find it.

188
00:10:53,980 --> 00:10:56,120
It might be trying to draw us into a trap.

189
00:10:56,120 --> 00:11:06,520
You won't escape from me this time, bug!

190
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:27,600
I'll use my raging inferno and burn them all to ash!

191
00:11:27,600 --> 00:11:38,640
We've finished neutralizing all the trap spells near the entrance.

192
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:39,400
Good.

193
00:11:39,540 --> 00:11:42,420
Take a moment to recover your mana, and then widen the search.

194
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:43,080
Yes, ma'am.

195
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:44,900
Go on, eat up everybody!

196
00:11:45,940 --> 00:11:47,140
Did you find anything?

197
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:52,460
No, thanks to Asta, we got to waste our time running away from a huge wave of lava instead.

198
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:53,760
Yep, happy to help.

199
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:58,280
We actually found a bunch of weird-ass treasure chests, but I didn't grab any because...

200
00:11:58,280 --> 00:11:59,180
They have legs!

201
00:11:59,660 --> 00:12:00,020
Yeah!

202
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:01,080
What is that?

203
00:12:01,180 --> 00:12:04,640
Why did you bring that back with you? Don't even think about opening it!

204
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:06,960
Oh, God.

205
00:12:07,860 --> 00:12:09,380
Close that thing already!

206
00:12:10,180 --> 00:12:11,620
You think we could eat that?

207
00:12:11,900 --> 00:12:13,580
I would rather not find out.

208
00:12:15,220 --> 00:12:16,280
What was that?

209
00:12:17,140 --> 00:12:22,840
The only ones who were still unaccounted for from the first group are Randall and Leo.

210
00:12:23,400 --> 00:12:26,380
I suppose this means those two are our lucky winners, then.

211
00:12:37,020 --> 00:12:38,140
Let's do this!

212
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:38,900
Yes, sir!

213
00:12:44,900 --> 00:12:46,180
Perish in flames!

214
00:12:46,180 --> 00:12:53,780
There are just too many of them to handle.

215
00:12:54,100 --> 00:12:58,260
But we are the proud Crimson Lion Kings, and we will never run away from the battlefield!

216
00:12:59,540 --> 00:13:00,340
Hold on!

217
00:13:00,340 --> 00:13:14,180
Leo!

218
00:13:14,180 --> 00:13:14,260
Leo!

219
00:13:20,260 --> 00:13:21,060
No!

220
00:13:21,060 --> 00:13:21,720
Randall!

221
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:24,620
Hurry up and get out of here, Leo!

222
00:13:26,300 --> 00:13:28,780
You have to survive, no matter what!

223
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:32,780
Leo, there's no doubt you're going to become the leader of this squad someday.

224
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:35,080
So let us buy you a little time.

225
00:13:35,500 --> 00:13:37,120
Please, get out of this place and live.

226
00:13:37,220 --> 00:13:38,500
Take the wounded with you.

227
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:41,020
It's happening again.

228
00:13:41,020 --> 00:13:44,080
What have I been training so hard for all this time?

229
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:44,140
What have I been training so hard for all this time?

230
00:13:44,140 --> 00:13:58,760
What was that?

231
00:13:59,500 --> 00:14:01,080
Don't sell yourself short, Leo.

232
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:03,840
I think that last battle brought you to the verge of a breakthrough.

233
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:06,800
That's right.

234
00:14:06,800 --> 00:14:11,340
When I fought Randall, I was caught inside his powerful mana field for the entire battle.

235
00:14:12,260 --> 00:14:13,580
None of my attacks could reach him.

236
00:14:14,220 --> 00:14:18,300
But I was still able to read his mana and maintain complete control over my flames.

237
00:14:22,820 --> 00:14:23,280
Leo!

238
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:36,880
Now it's time to get a little crazy in here.

239
00:14:37,060 --> 00:14:39,660
Hope you guys put up a good fight before I kill you.

240
00:14:39,980 --> 00:14:41,880
That spider has committed a grave sin.

241
00:14:42,040 --> 00:14:45,080
It devoured tons of undiscovered ingredients before I could.

242
00:14:45,260 --> 00:14:47,620
I'm going to make you pay for hurting my friends.

243
00:14:47,820 --> 00:14:49,440
Now begin the counterattack.

244
00:14:50,060 --> 00:14:51,260
Water creation magic.

245
00:14:51,760 --> 00:14:52,900
Sea dragons roar!

246
00:14:53,280 --> 00:14:57,720
This spell seems more powerful than before.

247
00:14:58,140 --> 00:14:59,420
Is that because of my training?

248
00:15:00,100 --> 00:15:01,220
Two on this!

249
00:15:01,620 --> 00:15:02,460
Flame magic!

250
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:05,260
Gargantuan exploding fireball!

251
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:07,000
Lightning magic!

252
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:08,580
Thunderbolt destruction!

253
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:10,400
Poison curse magic.

254
00:15:10,620 --> 00:15:11,920
Dwelling of the poison cloud.

255
00:15:13,100 --> 00:15:14,520
Cotton creation magic!

256
00:15:14,980 --> 00:15:16,460
Strike of the sleeping sheep!

257
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:18,660
Go secure Vice Captain Randall.

258
00:15:19,060 --> 00:15:19,860
Roger that!

259
00:15:19,860 --> 00:15:27,140
There's a ton of them.

260
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:28,540
We gotta stop the spider.

261
00:15:28,680 --> 00:15:30,880
It's the one controlling those things with its webs.

262
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:32,420
Let's finish this.

263
00:15:32,860 --> 00:15:33,240
No.

264
00:15:33,920 --> 00:15:35,280
It's my turn.

265
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:36,520
Hmm?

266
00:15:36,520 --> 00:15:40,700
I had a breakthrough.

267
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:42,680
And it's time to make use of it.

268
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:53,600
By pushing his senses to their limits and calmly reading the flow of mana surrounding him,

269
00:15:54,160 --> 00:16:00,540
Leopold is able to momentarily manipulate it, combining it with his own mana for an explosive increase in power.

270
00:16:00,540 --> 00:16:27,300
That was totally incredible!

271
00:16:27,300 --> 00:16:38,440
This must be the spider's original form.

272
00:16:39,160 --> 00:16:43,100
It seems this magic item causes its user's life force to grow out of control.

273
00:16:43,540 --> 00:16:46,760
And in the process, the power overload turns them into a monster.

274
00:16:46,760 --> 00:16:56,000
Excellent work in finding the treasure room.

275
00:16:56,440 --> 00:17:01,600
The trial you've endured here today will surely leave all of you better prepared for your coming battle with the devil.

276
00:17:01,920 --> 00:17:02,520
Yes, sir!

277
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:06,580
It took a while, but I think I'm starting to get the hang of this mana skin thing.

278
00:17:07,080 --> 00:17:09,420
And I can tell my spells are getting more powerful.

279
00:17:09,420 --> 00:17:14,860
Speaking of, did everyone else see that crazy strong spell Leo whipped out right at the end?

280
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:17,940
It happened so fast, I barely know what I did.

281
00:17:18,620 --> 00:17:19,640
What was that spell?

282
00:17:20,360 --> 00:17:21,680
And how do I control it?

283
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:23,540
Ha ha ha!

284
00:17:23,540 --> 00:17:25,480
Yes, rival, be amazed!

285
00:17:26,020 --> 00:17:29,360
Soon I shall master that spell and become stronger than you!

286
00:17:29,580 --> 00:17:31,680
Then I'll just have to get stronger than you!

287
00:17:32,080 --> 00:17:34,620
Then I'll be forced to become stronger still!

288
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:36,800
I'll get even stronger then!

289
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:39,620
Then I'll simply have to keep on getting stronger!

290
00:17:39,860 --> 00:17:42,480
I'll keep getting even stronger and stronger and stronger and stronger!

291
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:44,060
Let's stop your shouting!

292
00:17:44,240 --> 00:17:44,800
Yes, ma'am!

293
00:17:45,520 --> 00:17:47,480
This mission isn't over yet.

294
00:17:47,800 --> 00:17:49,840
Not until the magic item is secured.

295
00:17:50,120 --> 00:17:51,240
Right, here you go.

296
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:53,880
What is this?

297
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:55,220
What do you mean?

298
00:17:55,260 --> 00:17:56,200
It's the magic item.

299
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:59,340
It's a damn lump of coal, you absolute fools!

300
00:18:00,940 --> 00:18:04,580
Bringing back that magic item was our primary objective on this mission.

301
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:07,300
How could you idiots burn it to ash like this?

302
00:18:07,560 --> 00:18:08,180
You're right.

303
00:18:08,620 --> 00:18:09,920
We beg for your forgiveness.

304
00:18:10,380 --> 00:18:14,000
You're going back in and searching that dungeon from end to end,

305
00:18:14,120 --> 00:18:16,340
and you will not return empty-handed!

306
00:18:16,620 --> 00:18:17,300
Yes, ma'am!

307
00:18:17,860 --> 00:18:18,980
Wait, really?

308
00:18:19,320 --> 00:18:20,980
Come on, you can't be serious!

309
00:18:21,240 --> 00:18:22,240
She's serious.

310
00:18:22,500 --> 00:18:23,220
Dead serious?

311
00:18:23,800 --> 00:18:25,420
She's totally serious.

312
00:18:25,700 --> 00:18:28,200
Everybody else, get to the hot springs!

313
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:29,360
Yes, ma'am!

314
00:18:33,660 --> 00:18:34,600
Drink up!

315
00:18:35,520 --> 00:18:38,740
Well, I'm still not sure what all those ingredients are that I found in the dungeon,

316
00:18:38,740 --> 00:18:41,240
so I just squeezed anything that looked like it might have juice in it

317
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:45,060
and mixed it all up into this one super-special thirst-quenching dungeon drink!

318
00:18:47,060 --> 00:18:50,920
I have to admit, this bath is nice.

319
00:18:50,920 --> 00:18:55,380
It looks like you've been getting a bit closer to your mother.

320
00:18:55,380 --> 00:19:03,180
That form you used in your last battle, you were the living image of the steel warrior princess, Lady Asier.

321
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:05,800
You've still got a ways to go yet.

322
00:19:06,320 --> 00:19:08,740
Right now, your magic's not nearly as strong.

323
00:19:08,740 --> 00:19:11,360
Yeah, of course.

324
00:19:11,360 --> 00:19:15,040
The truth is exactly what you suspected.

325
00:19:15,580 --> 00:19:18,280
Asier Silva lost her life to a devil's curse.

326
00:19:18,960 --> 00:19:22,700
And what's worse, anyone who speaks of Asier's fate will share it with her.

327
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:25,420
That's the cruel nature of the curse that befell your mother,

328
00:19:25,600 --> 00:19:27,880
and within the real world, there's no way around it.

329
00:19:28,980 --> 00:19:31,960
But that just means I have to get stronger.

330
00:19:32,560 --> 00:19:34,140
Backing down is not an option.

331
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:36,200
Is that right?

332
00:19:36,920 --> 00:19:41,080
So, um, while we're here, could you tell me a little bit more about my mother?

333
00:19:42,180 --> 00:19:43,540
That could take a while.

334
00:19:44,260 --> 00:19:45,080
That's fine.

335
00:19:45,800 --> 00:19:47,300
Isn't this great?

336
00:19:47,780 --> 00:19:50,880
Man, the Crimson Lion King's captain is crazy uptight.

337
00:19:50,880 --> 00:19:53,260
He's like some freaky opposite version of Captain Yami.

338
00:19:53,940 --> 00:19:54,640
Listen well.

339
00:19:55,040 --> 00:19:58,060
These hot springs are more than a spot for an invigorating soak.

340
00:19:58,400 --> 00:19:58,980
Yes, sir!

341
00:19:59,340 --> 00:20:01,280
If the heat becomes too much to bear,

342
00:20:01,740 --> 00:20:04,960
you must keep your composure and quench your body and soul in cold water,

343
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:08,020
and return to the bath and push to your limits once more.

344
00:20:08,820 --> 00:20:11,660
Even as we relax, we must strive to overcome our weakness.

345
00:20:12,080 --> 00:20:12,700
Yes, sir!

346
00:20:13,060 --> 00:20:15,960
Furthermore, remember to cleanse your body before entering the bath,

347
00:20:16,020 --> 00:20:18,480
and don't let your towels come in contact with the water.

348
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:21,660
Make sure to rinse off the shower and bathing areas of hot water after using...

349
00:20:21,660 --> 00:20:23,560
My body and soul need a quench.

350
00:20:23,780 --> 00:20:26,300
How long can the captain keep talking like this?

351
00:20:26,740 --> 00:20:28,240
Have Asta and Leopold returned?

352
00:20:28,860 --> 00:20:30,900
I hope they get a chance to strengthen their bonds

353
00:20:30,900 --> 00:20:33,080
by washing each other's backs in the hot springs.

354
00:20:33,080 --> 00:20:37,220
Yeah, we kept looking till morning,

355
00:20:37,380 --> 00:20:39,740
and we still didn't find anything worth bringing with us.

356
00:20:40,180 --> 00:20:41,300
Anyway, that's my day.

357
00:20:41,380 --> 00:20:42,020
How were the springs?

358
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:43,980
Sweat the exhaustion straight out of me.

359
00:20:44,320 --> 00:20:46,440
With all the collagen in those ingredients I found,

360
00:20:46,520 --> 00:20:48,320
my skin feels smooth as silk!

361
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:49,960
She's not wrong.

362
00:20:50,200 --> 00:20:51,880
If it weren't in a strong magic region,

363
00:20:51,940 --> 00:20:53,020
I'd come here every day.

364
00:20:53,560 --> 00:20:55,300
Your skin looks really smooth, too!

365
00:20:55,440 --> 00:20:56,600
Hey, back off!

366
00:20:56,600 --> 00:20:59,240
That was a lot of fun!

367
00:20:59,440 --> 00:21:01,120
I hope we can train with them again soon!

368
00:21:01,920 --> 00:21:02,940
Are you crazy?

369
00:21:03,060 --> 00:21:05,540
That psycho kidnapped us and dragged us to a freaking volcano!

370
00:21:05,740 --> 00:21:07,740
If I never see her again, it'll be too soon!

371
00:21:08,080 --> 00:21:09,820
It'd be so funny if she was in there!

372
00:21:09,960 --> 00:21:11,300
Come on, there's no way!

373
00:21:11,300 --> 00:21:11,720
Ah!

374
00:21:12,520 --> 00:21:12,920
Ah!

375
00:21:13,640 --> 00:21:13,940
Ah!

376
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:16,280
Where are you?

377
00:21:16,800 --> 00:21:18,360
She's actually here!

378
00:21:18,360 --> 00:21:45,960
Oh, it's now!

379
00:21:45,960 --> 00:22:15,940
Thank you.

380
00:22:15,960 --> 00:22:22,960
There is only one there.

381
00:22:22,960 --> 00:22:24,960
I'm not mistaken.

382
00:22:24,960 --> 00:22:28,960
I'm not mistaken.

383
00:22:28,960 --> 00:22:32,960
I'm not mistaken.

384
00:22:32,960 --> 00:22:36,960
I'm not mistaken.

385
00:22:36,960 --> 00:22:40,960
I'm not mistaken.

386
00:22:40,960 --> 00:22:47,960
I'm not mistaken.

387
00:22:47,960 --> 00:22:57,960
I'm not mistaken.

388
00:22:57,960 --> 00:22:59,960
Here's the magic item!

389
00:22:59,960 --> 00:23:01,960
And what's with all these weird treasure chests?

390
00:23:01,960 --> 00:23:06,960
Envy me, rival, for I have discovered a treasure the likes of which our world has never seen!

391
00:23:06,960 --> 00:23:08,960
Its legs go all the way down!

392
00:23:08,960 --> 00:23:09,960
Oh man!

393
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:11,960
Those are pretty impressive, but take a look at this pair!

394
00:23:11,960 --> 00:23:13,960
Now those are some big beefy man legs!

395
00:23:13,960 --> 00:23:14,960
So buff!

396
00:23:14,960 --> 00:23:17,960
They make me want to bust out a set of squats!

397
00:23:17,960 --> 00:23:22,960
It seems we have no choice but to find out which of us can locate the greatest treasure chest in this dungeon!

398
00:23:22,960 --> 00:23:23,960
You up for it?

399
00:23:23,960 --> 00:23:24,960
Heck yeah!

400
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:25,960
You're wrong!

401
00:23:25,960 --> 00:23:26,960
Where is it?

402
00:23:26,960 --> 00:23:27,960
Where is it?

403
00:23:27,960 --> 00:23:28,960
Where is it?

404
00:23:28,960 --> 00:23:34,960
Having forgotten their mission entirely, Asta and Leopold continued goofing off through the night.

405
00:23:34,960 --> 00:23:37,960
It is a day of great consequence for the House of Vermillion!

406
00:23:37,960 --> 00:23:39,960
We straddle the line between life and death!

407
00:23:39,960 --> 00:23:41,960
For today, we receive her!

408
00:23:41,960 --> 00:23:48,960
Next time on Black Clover, page 134, those who have been gathered, let us welcome her with all we have!

